# Copy to bridge.env, fill in, chmod 600. Never commit the real file.
# (install.sh and ensure_listener.sh tighten the permissions to 600
# automatically if you forget.)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# Optional: where inbox.jsonl / allowlist.json / state/ live.
# Defaults to the kit root. Every component — listener, send_reply,
# hooks, watchdog, self-heal — resolves this the same way: a real
# environment variable wins, then this file, then the kit root. Setting
# it here is safe; it cannot split the bridge across two directories.
# TGBRIDGE_HOME=
